				<title>몇 주간 읽은 것들 정리</title>
				<link>https://ezaurum.com/2012/08/%EB%AA%87-%EC%A3%BC%EA%B0%84-%EC%9D%BD%EC%9D%80-%EA%B2%83%EB%93%A4-%EC%A0%95%EB%A6%AC/</link>
